12. Why Aptos？
-At Impakt, we’re shaping the future of AI-powered motion-controlled fitness gaming, and Aptos is the perfect blockchain to bring our vision to life. Its fast, low-latency transactions make real-time AI feedback possible, while the Move programming language ensures secure and efficient smart contracts for in-game assets and rewards. Aptos' developer-friendly ecosystem allows us to seamlessly integrate NFTs, tokenized incentives, and decentralized identities, boosting user engagement. With Aptos Movemaker’s support, we can scale our platform and transform fitness on a global scale.

